properties.description:
Three tests in the flow suite:
- entry and exit are the lowest and highest steps, and a step added last becomes the exit (the copy that went stale on flow:release-cut was a stored one);
- steps sharing an end position are all entries or exits;
- a flow with no stated order names neither and confesses the missing order.
The retired add_capability flag being refused by name is pinned in crates/reflow2-mcp/tests/the_fourteen_holes_are_writable.rs.
